WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
Jordan, this is exciting.

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.760
What are we about to do?

3
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.320
We're about to go on the hunt for Tuscan truffles,

4
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.100
the very rare fungus that only grows

5
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.700
at certain times of the year.

6
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.729
Anything we need to know about hunting for truffles?

7
00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:15.646
(speaking in foreign language)

8
00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.970
No, we don't need to know anything before.

9
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.313
All that to hear we didn't need to know anything?

10
00:00:28.313 --> 00:00:29.146
(audience laughing)

11
00:00:29.146 --> 00:00:30.650
So you're sure these dogs serve a purpose?

12
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:31.710
They do something?

13
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.560
They go this way?

14
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.313
What is that?

15
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:35.146
Is that a truffle?

16
00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.223
That's a truffle, right?

17
00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.423
Theses dogs just found a truffle.

18
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.113
Wait.

19
00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.063
What's this?

20
00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:48.896
You found another one?

21
00:00:50.107 --> 00:00:51.890
(speaking in foreign language)

22
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:52.723
Look at this.

23
00:00:52.723 --> 00:00:53.870
They just found another one.

24
00:00:54.856 --> 00:00:57.290
Psst, get in here.
(audience chuckling)

25
00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.570
I strongly suspect these guys,

26
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:01.365
because they knew we were coming,

27
00:01:01.365 --> 00:01:03.760
hid these ahead of time
(audience laughs)

28
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.863
because they're finding them very easily.

29
00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.410
Don't you think so?
I concur.

30
00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:13.315
They keep going, "Oh, look, a-the truffle."

31
00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:15.817
And we're barely even looking for them.

32
00:01:15.817 --> 00:01:18.260
Can you get down like you're a truffle pig.

33
00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.230
Do you mind?
Sure.

34
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.820
Oink oink, oink oink.
(audience laughing)

35
00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.870
Get out of the way!

36
00:01:24.763 --> 00:01:25.910
A truffle!

37
00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:26.743
You did it.

38
00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:29.160
Good job, Oinky.
Thank you.

39
00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:31.480
That's as legitimate as anything

40
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.971
these guys have been doing.

41
00:01:32.971 --> 00:01:35.680
I'm sorry but we've been scammed.

42
00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.730
(audience laughing)

43
00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.780
What I would like to do

44
00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:41.200
is go very deep into the woods,

45
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.450
and once we are very, very deep in the woods,

46
00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.880
I would like-

47
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:46.713
(Jordan speaking foreign language)

48
00:01:46.713 --> 00:01:47.845
-to kill my friend.

49
00:01:47.845 --> 00:01:50.327
(Jordan speaking foreign language)

50
00:01:50.327 --> 00:01:51.760
That's okay?

51
00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:52.700
They don't mind.
Fantastic.

52
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.780
I love these guys, let's go.
(audience laughing)

53
00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.445
Ask him where the pigs are right now.

54
00:01:56.445 --> 00:01:57.278
Do you use pigs?

55
00:01:57.278 --> 00:01:59.615
(speaking foreign language)

56
00:01:59.615 --> 00:02:00.448
No, it's prohibited.

57
00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:01.690
You can't use pigs here.

58
00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.630
Tell him that I might wish to use rabbits

59
00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.540
to find my truffles.

60
00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.050
Why does the government care if I use a rabbit-

61
00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.055
Because the rabbit doesn't have the nose for it.

62
00:02:11.055 --> 00:02:13.820
Oh, I'm sick of the rabbit

63
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.543
being subjugated in this country.

64
00:02:16.605 --> 00:02:18.255
I think I'm losing my mind.

65
00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:20.690
It's very cold and very dark.

66
00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.350
I don't know these guys and I'm with Jordan.

67
00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:26.320
And they said it was okay for me to kill Jordan.

68
00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.680
These dogs are finding truffles

69
00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.885
that have been hidden clearly minutes before we got here.

70
00:02:30.885 --> 00:02:32.603
This whole thing's a goddamn scam.

71
00:02:33.615 --> 00:02:36.067
(Conan fake laughs)
(audience laughing)

72
00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:38.710
I feel that he works harder than he does.

73
00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:41.793
Lui's always in the corner like this.

74
00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.520
Oh.

75
00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:47.580
A companion at work who does nothing.

76
00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.413
You're Lui.

77
00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.180
I am the truffle hunter.

78
00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.950
I do all the work at The late night show.

79
00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.350
You apparently do nothing.

80
00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:58.040
You stand off to the side,

81
00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.140
yet you get to share in the truffles

82
00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:03.633
that I have dug in the earth with my hands.

83
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.720
We came hunting for truffles,

84
00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.817
instead we found a nugget of truth.

85
00:03:09.817 --> 00:03:12.650
(audience laughs)

